2. Select Other Options.
3. Configure precision for Currency, Non-Currency, and Percentage values.
4. Optionally select Use Currency Member Precision Setting.
5. Associate Context Menus, if required.
6. Select Enable Dynamic User Variables where needed.
7. Click Save.
